  Version 20261005~sparky9~0 (2026-10-05)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * The default look is Oxygen, whole (Daniel, 2026-10-05): the Oxygen application style and the Oxygen window decoration replace the qt6ct style and the Plastik borders
  * sparky-stereo-look depends on kde-style-oxygen-qt6 and kwin-decoration-oxygen (were recommended); Sparky black now names qt6ct and kwin-style-aurorae itself
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261002~sparky9~0 (2026-10-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Add the SDDM theme sparky-stereo-black, a Qt 6 port of sparky-black (QtQuick.Controls 2, Kirigami, KSvg, KeyboardIndicator); the Qt 5 original fell back to the embedded theme
  * Drop the battery line of the greeter's clock pane (Plasma 6 has no powermanagement data engine)
  * Fix the splashes of sparkyblack, sparkystereo and QPlatinum: the intro animation moved a bottomRect that does not exist (ReferenceError in Plasma 6)
  * Version scheme changed to the generation-tied YYYYMMDD~sparky9~0 (sorts above 1.0~dev1)
  * Patches against the originals in upstream-patches/ (to offer Pawel and KDE; nothing sent)
